;; expect: ok
;; a constant the toolchain builds by name from a type it meets: the derivation of equality at
;; `(List Tok)` cites List.cons.inj, which is no token of this file and no part of the fixed
;; kit. The first reading's refusal names it; the loader fetches it and reads the form again
(type Tok (TA) (TB Nat))
(derive Tok eq)
(derive (List Tok) eq)
